  id: S-03
  lines:
  - speaker: "Takas\xE7\u0131 G\xFCls\xFCm"
    text: "Bahar, d\xFCn biri sekiz kavanoz can havas\u0131 alm\u0131\u015F, yar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131
      bana satt\u0131."
  - speaker: "K\xF6r\xFCk\xE7\xFC Bahar"
    text: "Saymadan alm\u0131\u015F. Kazan ne isterse o kadar alacaks\u0131n."
  - speaker: "Takas\xE7\u0131 G\xFCls\xFCm"
    text: "Ben \u015Fik\xE2yet\xE7i de\u011Filim ama."
